    "text": "Alan Hernandez takes male 30-39 title at CHASS 5K Run/Walk & Kid's Superhero Race in Detroit on Aug. 8, 2026\nBy\nM. C. ConleyAlan Hernandez won the male 30-39 division of the 5K Run/Walk at CHASS 5K Run/Walk & Kid's Superhero Race in Detroit, Michigan on Aug. 8, 2026, posting a time of 20:38.5 and placing 4th overall, according to RunSignUp results.\nHernandez, 33, was listed with a hometown of Detroit, Michigan.",
